        given-names: M.
    year: 2024
    journal: Communications Medicine
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Associating genes and protein complexes with disease
      via network propagation
    authors:
      - family-names: Vanunu
        given-names: O.
    year: 2010
    journal: PLoS Computational Biology
  - type: article
    title: Network-based in silico drug efficacy screening
